# Loamcrafter Faun: Bot1 discards both Islands in its hand, so the reflexive ability returns up to two (CR 603.12):
# Black Lotus and Lotus Petal both come back to Bot1's hand, together.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Lotus Petal
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Loamcrafter Faun
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Loamcrafter Faun.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Island; Island)
Bot1.Target(Black Lotus; Lotus Petal)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Black Lotus; Lotus Petal
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Island; Lightning Bolt
